+nEBULA latency-aware compact transformation-choice validation
+Date: 2026-09-14
+
+Implemented:
+- LLM remains free to choose pipeline insertion from the first attempt when latency headroom exists.
+- Latency is described as a limited optimization resource; no attempt-count/stagnation transform gate was added.
+- Response schema bumped to 3.3 with primary_transformation + proposed_transformations; vague mixed classification removed.
+- Backend records structural_effects independently from model transformation intent.
+- Model-visible history is bounded to the last 5 meaningful attempts by default; older history is aggregated into search_summary.
+- Latest feedback is compacted to essential PPA/latency fields.
+- Identical Golden/Current-Best RTL source text is not duplicated (existing v1.1 mechanism retained and regression-tested).
+- max completion tokens remains 6500.
+- Existing temporal verifier flatten fix is retained unchanged.
+- Legacy schema-3.0 replay is now strictly validated before compatibility extraction.
